I'm using the same dataframe I used to get the significant interaction terms, and also the direct and indirect effects that are in my syntax below.

pathmodel4.1 <- "engagement ~ psymean + eudaimonia + future + impulsec + decisionm + egoDep + b*intrin + c*hedonia
